# Testing

- Prefer fakes over mocks for Source/Repository/Translator
- Use Turbine for multi-emission Flow asserts; Truth for assertions
- Parser tests MUST use fixtures + golden JSON (AO3 Next_Best_Thing, Ficbook samples)
- Translation unit tests MUST use FakeTranslationProvider (no live Gemini)
- Room: in-memory DB in unit/androidTest as appropriate
- Compose UI tests: prefer semantics; `testTag` only when needed; prefer Compose test v2 APIs when available
